    "html": "<p>A sealed container holds a fixed mass of ideal gas A. The density of  gas A is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\rho\"></span> and the rms speed of its molecules is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. An identical sealed container holds a fixed mass of ideal gas B. The density of gas B is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3\\rho\"></span> and the rms speed of its molecules is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{2}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textup{internal energy of gas A}}{\\textup{internal energy of gas B}}\\,?\"></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4}{3}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{4}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2}{3}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{2}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
